    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.01,
      401.87,
      380.99
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Licensing of ShippingAgents, Freight Forwarders, Non-Vessel Operating CommonCarriers and Container Operators (Amendment) Act,No. \u2026\u2026 of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      393.53,
      401.92,
      440.51
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 3 of the Licensing of Shipping Agents, FreightForwarders, Non- Vessel Operating Common Carriers andContainer Operators Act, No. 10 of 1972 is hereby amendedin subsection (5) thereof as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      452.93,
      401.87,
      488.15
    ],
    "text": "(1)in paragraph (e) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201ccontravention of such standards.\u201d of thewords \u201ccontravention of such standards; and\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      500.57,
      401.85,
      523.79
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the addition at the end of the paragraph (e) ofthat subsection, of the following new paragraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      196.29,
      536.33,
      401.88,
      619.07
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(f) a charge, levy and tariff imposed by therelevant service providers of shipping agents,freight forwarders, non-vessel operatingcommon carriers and container operators forthe services rendered by them, and regulatingthe procedure of imposing and collecting suchcharge, levy and tariff .\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      631.49,
      401.89,
      654.83
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
